		<unit label="article" identifier="3" level="5">Seed Potato Standards</unit>
	</structure>
	<section_number>3.2-1817</section_number>
	<catch_line>Exempted sales</catch_line>
	<text>
		Nothing in this article shall prohibit the sale of seed potatoes sold by the grower to a planter who has personal knowledge of the conditions under which the seed potatoes were grown.
	</text>
	<history>Code 1950, § 3-228.10; 1950, p. 1030; 1958, c. 94; 1966, c. 702, § 3.1-294; 2008, c. 860, § 3.2-4106; 2012, cc. 803, 835.</history>
</law>
